{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01630",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.53,
      "end_seconds": 4.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Good evening, doctor, thanks for seeing me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.59,
      "end_seconds": 9.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 10.47,
      "end_seconds": 16.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.99,
      "text": "Oh, doctor, I'll sit in if that's okay, I know what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.98,
      "end_seconds": 22.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "Of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 23.67,
      "end_seconds": 29.93,
      "duration_seconds": 6.26,
      "text": "Doctor, it's a tingling lip then a blister. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.77,
      "end_seconds": 33.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Okay, when did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.9,
      "end_seconds": 38.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Right, about three days, give or take."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 39.66,
      "end_seconds": 43.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Hm, I'd say more like five days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.65,
      "end_seconds": 49.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Okay, so roughly three to five days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.33,
      "end_seconds": 56.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "That sounds about right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.93,
      "end_seconds": 62.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.68,
      "end_seconds": 76.46,
      "duration_seconds": 11.78,
      "text": "Honestly, all the time. I notice it more with sunlight and stress. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.11,
      "end_seconds": 84.13,
      "duration_seconds": 7.02,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 84.23,
      "end_seconds": 90.25,
      "duration_seconds": 6.02,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.35,
      "end_seconds": 100.36,
      "duration_seconds": 8.01,
      "text": "I was getting to that! I've also had a mild sore feeling, for two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.92,
      "end_seconds": 104.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.84,
      "end_seconds": 109.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "I'd give it a four, out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 111.63,
      "end_seconds": 113.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Yes, exactly like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.35,
      "end_seconds": 132.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any fever, rash elsewhere or eye pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.69,
      "end_seconds": 144.75,
      "duration_seconds": 11.06,
      "text": "No, no fever, no rash elsewhere, no eye pain. I did have crusting at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.96,
      "end_seconds": 149.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "And sores in the mouth, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.6,
      "end_seconds": 154.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Nope, no sores in the mouth."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.48,
      "end_seconds": 160.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.63,
      "end_seconds": 164.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.57,
      "end_seconds": 170.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.0,
      "end_seconds": 177.42,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, not to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 179.0,
      "end_seconds": 186.79,
      "duration_seconds": 7.79,
      "text": "Actually, I remember he had some kind of reaction to diclofenac before. I couldn't swear to it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.66,
      "end_seconds": 191.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Really? I don't think so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.76,
      "end_seconds": 198.53,
      "duration_seconds": 6.77,
      "text": "Okay, I'll note both of those. Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.4,
      "end_seconds": 207.02,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "I've had heart failure, yes. I, I have arthritis in my knees, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.0,
      "end_seconds": 209.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Okay, go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.51,
      "end_seconds": 221.21,
      "duration_seconds": 7.7,
      "text": "I've got diabetes. I did try to ignore it for a while. Yes, epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.15,
      "end_seconds": 227.65,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "Alright, arthritis in your knees and epilepsy, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.01,
      "end_seconds": 240.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.93,
      "end_seconds": 249.09,
      "duration_seconds": 7.16,
      "text": "It's a... um, I can't remember what it's called. It's a little pink tablet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.94,
      "end_seconds": 257.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.42,
      "end_seconds": 277.09,
      "duration_seconds": 18.67,
      "text": "For the knee pain, I believe. My husband sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given. Metformin, 500 milligrams, twice a day. So, I take lamotrigine, 100 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.81,
      "end_seconds": 283.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.48,
      "end_seconds": 287.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "My grandmother had dementia."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.49,
      "end_seconds": 292.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 293.53,
      "end_seconds": 299.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "Mm, I had an operation for a hernia last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.8,
      "end_seconds": 303.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.74,
      "end_seconds": 316.18,
      "duration_seconds": 10.44,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal. I gave up cigarettes last spring. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.43,
      "end_seconds": 320.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.99,
      "end_seconds": 329.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.94,
      "end_seconds": 355.02,
      "duration_seconds": 8.08,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 114 over 75, SpO2 97 percent on room air, pulse is 76 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 355.96,
      "end_seconds": 357.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.53,
      "end_seconds": 376.99,
      "duration_seconds": 18.46,
      "text": "We'll go over that shortly. For this, aciclovir cream, 5%, five times a day, five days. That's for cold sore. Avoid kissing and sharing towels until it has crusted over. Let's review you if not healed in ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 378.93,
      "end_seconds": 382.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Come by reception afterwards and I'll fix the appointment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 384.7,
      "end_seconds": 390.88,
      "duration_seconds": 6.18,
      "text": "Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 392.61,
      "end_seconds": 403.54,
      "duration_seconds": 10.93,
      "text": "So, I take the aciclovir cream, 5%, five times a day and come back if not healed in ten days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 404.78,
      "end_seconds": 408.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 409.68,
      "end_seconds": 415.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "I mean, you know, good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 416.82,
      "end_seconds": 418.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Alright, all the best."
    }
  ]
}